WEBVTT

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.420
What a wonderful mansion this is!

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.390
My daughter will enter the court as an imperial bride.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.030
And I shall become the father-in-law of the Heavenly Emperor.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:21.860
Therefore, the house must be built accordingly.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:27.940
If the Vice-Minister overhears, you will gain more unnecessary resentment.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.670
This is how I am at my most modest.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.240
Please wait.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.380
Haruaki<i>-sama</i>!

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.420
What business do you have, Haruaki?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.290
I felt an alarming presence

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:51.430
so I dragged this aging body of mine to see you.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.960
What are you saying?

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.700
Do you believe something sinister is here?

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.130
Yes.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.890
Hey, look.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:24.390
This is...

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.760
A curse.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:30.270
Someone is cursing Michinaga<i>-dono.</i>

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:35.830
If the one who stood there was not a dog, but Michinaga<i>-dono...</i>

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:58.830
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:06.940
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:14.140
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:02:14.140 --> 00:02:23.180
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:32.530
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:40.370
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:48.310
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:58.320
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:04.430
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:08.960
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:13.960
"CURSE"

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:27.610
Seimei! Hurry! Please hurry and remove the seal!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.860
Seimei!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.290
What are you doing so early in the morning?!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.600
A dream?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.630
Seimei, are you going to eat before you go?

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.230
What kind of sweets do you have?

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.720
Persimmons.

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:51.910
Seimei, please do something about the seal on my armor.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:54.640
Why? Did a Horror appear?

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.580
I am going to cut my ties with you!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.750
Such cold words.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.120
When I picked you up, you didn't even know what a Makai Knight was.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:08.120
Though I taught you everything there is to know...

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.260
Men are all the same.

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.390
Wha...!

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.600
They take everything away from older women

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.770
and step over their body on the way out.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.640
No, I didn't mean it that way.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.900
Those are crocodile tears.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.530
Huh?

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:28.470
Just a bit more and I might actually produce some tears...

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.750
You're always like this.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.080
Lies! Lies! Lies!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:38.120
Because of you, I can no longer trust the words of women.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:41.190
Do you even know that many women?

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.990
This persimmon is sweet!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.590
Let me go!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.760
Oh, where are you going?

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.770
I'm going to go cool my head.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.270
Huh?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.640
The unlawful <i>onmyou</i> user, Seimei.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.270
We are taking you into custody for suspicion of cursing activity.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:58.610
Huh? W-Wait a second!

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.800
Attack!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.310
Wh-What are you doing?!
I'm changing right now!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:05.150
Where are you touching?!

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.220
Pay up if you're going to touch!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.720
Raiko<i>-sama</i>!

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:13.150
Did she do something bad enough to be captured by the police magistrate?

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.560
That is what we are going to investigate.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.890
She's good at lying, so don't be fooled.

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:19.560
Hey! Raiko!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:22.890
You're going to abandon me?!
You ungrateful brat!

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:28.000
I assume you are familiar with the name Fujiwarano Michinaga?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.640
Someone placed curses on his family.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.510
They found cursed items inside the mansion, one after another.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:38.710
Michinaga's daughter will soon enter the court as an imperial bride.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:44.590
If so, many would be envious of the one who controls the Light Palace.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:52.190
Unlawful <i>onmyou</i> users create curses in exchange for money regularly.

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:55.100
That kind of activity is no longer forgivable.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:55.900
Yes.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.700
It has already been decided,

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.340
that <i>onmyou</i> users who've created curses will be severely punished.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:05.570
We will now sweep out all the unlawful <i>onmyou</i> users.

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:11.250
And so, any <i>onmyouji</i> that are not a part of the Onmyouryo

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.680
are to be inspected.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.190
Um, Izumi Shikibu<i>-san</i>?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.720
Izumi<i>-chan</i> is fine.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:23.760
Seimei is a Makai Alchemist and she's not one of the <i>onmyouji</i>

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:27.100
that protect the Light Palace from disasters.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:29.460
Oh? You didn't know?

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.970
That child was born from an <i>onmyouji</i> family.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:32.700
Huh?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.740
She is the princess of the Abe family,

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:39.110
who surpasses even the <i>onmyou</i> professor Kamono Yasunori.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:43.040
I have no idea why she became a Makai Alchemist,

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:46.380
but I am sure she'll be released quickly.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.150
Shake?

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:49.950
Information fee.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.320
The Light Palace.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:07:00.930
A holy place that only nobles and officials that run this country may enter...

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:04.900
Yes, they say that Horrors cannot enter the palace.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:08.800
Seimei was born from a place like that?

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:17.110
Michinaga wouldn't fear mere curses.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:20.180
His true goal is you.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:23.350
Then allow me to show him that there is no light

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.490
that can pierce true darkness.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.090
Did you find him? After him!

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:33.090
Having the conceited Light Palace open the gate would be interesting.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.760
Are you Ashiya Douman?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.460
It is as you say.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.440
Hurry up and enter the cells, you cheating <i>onmyouji</i>!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.440
Come now! Walk faster!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:50.180
Brother. Though Michinaga<i>-sama</i> is powerful, he is still an official.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:56.820
Making a prison in this mansion and jailing whomever he desires is too much.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.890
Our master is the head of the Fujiwara family.

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.460
No one may go against his decision.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.120
So these are the scum who sell curses for money.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.400
That woman...

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.570
She was born of high status.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:18.070
What a waste.

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:19.370
Please save me.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.010
Hey! Get back in line!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.140
This is some kind of mistake!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:30.020
That Madou Ring is sealed away along with your armor.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.720
The only one who can unseal it is that little lady.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.720
Can't something be done?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.860
Someone has cursed the Minister of the Left.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.260
Oh, that has nothing to do with us.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.500
Huh? Nothing to do with us?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:47.670
Curses placed by humans are mostly mere trickery.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:52.540
If they believe themselves to be cursed, they feel sick and get prone to disease.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:55.380
If there are rumors of being hated,

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.680
social advancement slips through their fingers.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:02.950
Makai Knights do not interfere with the world of man.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:08.460
I will call for you if another troublesome Horror appears.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.590
Makai Knights are protectors!

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.230
I will protect all people!

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.060
See you later, Raiko.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.030
Good-bye.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:28.540
Makai Knight armor uses the power of Makai.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.050
If you wear it for too long,

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.750
you will be consumed by the armor and turn into a beast.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.720
A lost soul beast.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:44.290
When I met Seimei, I had lost my sanity while wearing the armor.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:48.400
But, Raiko<i>-sama</i>, you weren't going berserk.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.670
Though your form had changed, your soul remained intact.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.570
That is why Seimei...

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:58.610
She sealed away the armor, making me hers!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.840
To protect Raiko<i>-sama</i>?

00:10:00.840 --> 00:10:02.610
No, it can't be.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.810
It can't be helped. Let's go.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.810
To save Seimei?

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:10.950
Yes. What would happen if a
Horror were to appear right now?

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.790
That is...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:58.470
So you are the new Ashiya Douman.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:02.340
That is the name I have received from my teacher.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:07.510
So that man accepted you as his successor?

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:13.120
The various curses we found.
They were your doing, were they not?

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.450
I have no memory of them.

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:17.890
No, you made them.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:24.400
And the one who commissioned you was the Vice-Minister Korechika<i>-kyo.</i>

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:30.000
Korechika<i>-kyo</i> is Michinaga<i>-dono</i>'s nephew, but he hungers for power.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.900
That is why he had you create those curses.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.970
If I confess such things in public,

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:41.210
Korechika and his bloodline will be executed.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:42.980
Ashiya Douman.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:49.420
Though he was once as skilled as I as an <i>onmyouji,</i>

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:54.230
people grew to fear his mastery of curses.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:12:00.100
There is no mistake.
The one who carries his name is the culprit.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:05.900
You captured all the <i>omyou</i> users in the capital just to find me.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:09.370
Good work on that.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.780
What is that terrible smell?

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.110
What is that smoke?

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.510
I-It stinks.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.210
Hey, what the hell is this smell?

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:19.250
The stench is unbearable!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.950
Shut up! Shut up!

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.440
Where is this smoke coming from?

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.300
Raiko, you're late!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.900
This is pathetic.
A Makai Knight doing a prison break!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.770
I'm the pathetic one!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.030
This cow dung stinks!

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:49.250
You cannot pass! Unlawful <i>onmyou</i> users, return to your cells!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.720
That's impossible.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.950
I already broke the prison door and it really stinks here.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:55.750
Are you a warrior?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.820
I, Minamotono Yorinobu, will be the opponent

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:00.490
of all who go against Michinaga<i>-sama</i>!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.330
Yorinobu?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.300
Please save me, Yorinobu<i>-sama</i>!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.100
This man suddenly attacked the jail!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.130
What?!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:12.770
I am sure he is aiming for my body, Yorinobu<i>-sama.</i>

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:13.640
It is as you say...

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.810
What are you saying?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:15.800
Hey, Seimei.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.740
Your face oozes with indecency.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.810
I won't let you escape!

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:29.010
Seimei!

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.130
Douman! Michinaga!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.690
Well, well.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:37.700
So you were captured as well.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.330
What are you doing here, Kiyome?!

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:44.200
Do not call me by that name, Abeno Haruaki.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:47.640
It's a reunion between grandfather and granddaughter.

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.610
There is no reason to fight.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:54.210
What will you do with Ashiya Douman?

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:56.650
It has nothing to do with you!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.680
This man placed the curses on me.

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:03.690
He just confessed who commissioned the curses.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.020
Someone who inherited Ashiya Douman's name

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.860
would do something that stupid?

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.950
Do you really think I would?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.750
Douman!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.870
Huh?

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.980
Seimei, isn't that the one named Douman?

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.020
Darkness.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.160
This is the gate of darkness that I searched for!

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.830
Darkness, huh?

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.160
Listen.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:49.600
These cursed items are things that Michinaga commissioned.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.900
Such nonsense!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:54.070
Those are curses against the Minister of the Left!

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:57.370
I saw a dog die in his place with my own eyes!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:00.850
He set poison in the garden ahead of time.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:03.510
He pretended to be cursed,

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:08.420
in order to blame and execute the Vice-Minister and his family.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.020
That was his goal.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:14.390
These pieces of junk contain no power.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:19.600
However, these items are imbued with negativity.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.530
The ambition to destroy his political enemies.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.900
The cruelty to stop at nothing for that sake.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:30.210
And the desire to stand at the top of this world.

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:32.810
That negativity will open this gate!

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.210
What?!

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:36.980
A gate that connects Makai and this world.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:40.620
Horrors use those gates to appear in our world.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.820
I am one who opens such gates.

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:53.260
I see. You let yourself be captured for this purpose, Douman!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:58.260
Horrors, follow the path of resentment and come to consume humans!

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.200
Evil spirits!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:36.670
Those are Horrors, creatures from the darkness.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:37.540
I see.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:43.180
The <i>onmyouji</i> believe they protect the area around the Light Palace,

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:46.780
but gates can be opened anywhere.

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.950
Stop, Raiko. We're vastly outnumbered.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:51.660
We need to focus on catching Douman.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:53.680
I want to protect the people!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:34.090
S-Seimei, hurry and release the seal on Raiko<i>-sama.</i>

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.500
Seimei!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.910
Shine light upon Raiko!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.520
Golden armor?

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:06.820
Raiko, you know that there will never be an end to Horrors.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.020
I am a Makai Knight.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:13.350
I will destroy all Horrors.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:21.090
If you can't stand that, release me from this cursed seal!

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.970
He did it!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:24.700
I will overlook the fact you destroyed the prison today.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.870
Yes, and I'll overlook the fact that your fake curse incident

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.910
involved me and many innocent people.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.580
Oh, this.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.950
Hold on to that.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:43.450
I couldn't do anything for you when you left the house so young.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:46.090
So, at the very least...

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:49.360
You may have become a Makai Alchemist,

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:55.130
but never forget you are from the Abe family of <i>onmyouji</i>, Kiyome.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:00.970
Kiyome, huh?

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:03.710
Don't call me by that name.

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:06.140
Why did you leave the Abe family?

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.580
Various things were really stifling.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.280
You're lying.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:15.150
You really don't understand women, do you?

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.250
Stupid! Quit it!

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:19.420
More importantly, please remove the seal you placed on me!

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.320
No way.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:23.760
So instead, I will never disappear from your side.

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:37.100
Stay away, Yorimitsu!

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:42.810
How are you doing, Father?

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:55.160
Yorinobu.

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:59.250
It's nothing. Just a dream.

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:02.960
Father.

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:10.210
The Golden Armor should be something passed down the Minamoto family line.

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:15.650
Why does a man like that possess it?

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.640
Father!

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:44.980
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:52.150
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:59.090
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.090 --> 00:23:02.660
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:06.100
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:09.230
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:11.870
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:16.540
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:23.550
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:30.020
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.020 --> 00:23:37.260
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:40.560
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:48.270
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:01.000
"Next Episode: KAGUYA"

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.800
Long, long ago.

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:57.970
There was a man called Taketorino Okina...

00:23:57.970 --> 00:24:00.740
No. No. This isn't such a story.
